  DTS:Description="Builds the outbound partner sales feed. Partners receive only the lines for their own accounts, EU partner rows are stripped of any personal data the customer has not consented to share, and amounts are restated into the partner's settlement currency. The feed is written to the outbound share and a copy is kept for the audit trail."
